{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_11211450","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11211450","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1121145001:1":{"text":"Bryon, we're here!","source_cn":"布莱恩，我们来啦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7E2B25F1DB07393B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1121145002:1":{"text":"Welcome. It's been a while.","source_cn":"欢迎，好久不见。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5270FCAA2BC826B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1121145003:2":{"text":"I sense a different vibe here. It seems to be more crowded than before.","source_cn":"感觉月影乡的氛围不太一样了呢，人好像变多了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C2698AE96C9FA7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1121145004:1":{"text":"The people are at ease. Since the corruption in the forest was purged with the help of the Deer Spirit's blessing, visitors have been able to make a pilgrimage to the Spirit Mound outside of ritual times.","source_cn":"人心已安。自从鹿灵赐福，协助丛林祛除腐化后，除了祭祀的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0EE192249383276A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1121145005:2":{"text":"One of Lyca's wishes is to strengthen communication and cooperation between the Dark Forest and the Vaduso Mountains so timely support can be provided when needed.","source_cn":"这也是莱卡的愿望之一：薄暮丛林与瓦度索山脉加强沟通联合...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2ADEFB756B5FB6B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1121145005":{"text":"One of Lyca's wishes is to strengthen communication and cooperation between the Dark Forest and the Vaduso Mountains so timely support can be provided when needed.","source_cn":"这也是莱卡的愿望之一：薄暮丛林与瓦度索山脉加强沟通联合，如有需要，及时支援。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2ADEFB756B5FB6B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1121145006:1":{"text":"Your aid greatly helped us in this regard.","source_cn":"其中有您的功勋。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x896F80118ED15994","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Your aid greatly helped us in this regard.","female":"Your aid greatly helped us in this regard.","variant_male_record_index":"101091","variant_female_record_index":"101092","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1121145007:1":{"text":"Now, the Deer Spirit seems to have manifested itself again. Therefore, Lyca has entrusted me to share the news with our savior and invite you to join the celebration through a wind message.","source_cn":"而今，鹿灵似乎再次显灵，因此莱卡托我向薄暮丛林的恩人传...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x64C99542C57145B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1121145008:1":{"te